From 7d704c822466c050c0ee92c1100146bff8ac6b62 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Woody Chow <woodychow@google.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 02:07:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix IntMin calculation in SanitizeUBofDivRem pass

In fixSignedDivRem(), `(int64_t)1 << (T->getScalarSizeInBits() - 1)`
shifts 1 in a 64-bit signed integer, producing a positive value
(+2^(N-1)) for integer bit widths N < 64 (e.g., +2147483648 for i32)
rather than the minimum signed N-bit value (-2^(N-1)).

Previously, ConstantInt::getSigned(T, IntMin) silently truncated bits
above N. Since llvm/llvm-project@a83c89495ba6
(https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project/commit/a83c89495ba6),
ConstantInt::getSigned() defaults `ImplicitTrunc` to false and asserts
`llvm::isIntN(BitWidth, val)` in APInt's constructor, which aborts when
compiling any kernel with non-constant signed 8-, 16-, or 32-bit integer
division or remainder.

Use APInt::getSignedMinValue(T->getScalarSizeInBits()) and
ConstantInt::get(T, IntMin) to construct the exact N-bit signed minimum
value across all integer bit widths and LLVM versions.

Co-authored-by: Gemini 4 Argon
(cherry picked from commit 52e1fbb2040950078fde797d50313c358d41200d)
---
 lib/llvmopencl/SanitizeUBofDivRem.cc | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/lib/llvmopencl/SanitizeUBofDivRem.cc b/lib/llvmopencl/SanitizeUBofDivRem.cc
index 411da4271..e8292bb1e 100644
--- a/lib/llvmopencl/SanitizeUBofDivRem.cc
+++ b/lib/llvmopencl/SanitizeUBofDivRem.cc
@@ -82,9 +82,9 @@ static void fixSignedDivRem(IRBuilder<> &Builder, BinaryOperator *BinI,
   Value *Condition1 = Builder.CreateCmp(CmpInst::Predicate::ICMP_EQ, Divisor,
                                         ConstantInt::getSigned(T, -1));
   // smallest negative value representable in given integer bit width
-  int64_t IntMin = (int64_t)1 << (T->getScalarSizeInBits() - 1);
+  APInt IntMin = APInt::getSignedMinValue(T->getScalarSizeInBits());
   Value *Condition2 = Builder.CreateCmp(CmpInst::Predicate::ICMP_EQ, Dividend,
-                                        ConstantInt::getSigned(T, IntMin));
+                                        ConstantInt::get(T, IntMin));
   Value *BothConds = Builder.CreateAnd(Condition1, Condition2);
   Value *ConditionZExt = Builder.CreateZExt(BothConds, Dividend->getType());
   Value *FixedDividend = Builder.CreateAdd(Dividend, ConditionZExt);
-- 
